e-aiguestortes","https://smexperiences.com/en/adventure-sports/snowshoes/snowshoeing-in-aiguestortes/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Romanesque church trail in the Vall de Boi","type":"experience","detail":"Nine stone churches with slender bell towers sit in villages at the western gate of the park, listed together by UNESCO in 2000.","link":"https://www.centreromanic.com/en/world-heritage/","evidence":{"n_sources":7,"of":27,"urls":["https://whc.unesco.org/en/list/988/","https://www.centreromanic.com/en/world-heritage/","https://pirineu365.cat/en/summer/boitaull/experiences/romanesque-churches-of-vall-de-boi/","https://everything-everywhere.com/unesco-world-heritage-site-148-catalan-romanesque-churches-of-the-vall-de-boi/","https://www.spain.info/en/nature/aiguestortes-national-park/","https://curiositysavestravel.com/national-park-catalonia-spain-aiguestortes-i-estany-de-sant-maurici/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Walk in to Estany de Sant Maurici from Espot","type":"trail","detail":"An easy few kilometres from the village to the lake under the twin spires of Els Encantats, with a shore loop of under an hour.","season":[5,6,7,8,9,10],"evidence":{"n_sources":6,"of":27,"urls":["https://www.alltrails.com/parks/spain/lleida/parque-nacional-de-aiguestortes-y-lago-de-san-mauricio","https://www.komoot.com/guide/3630034/easy-hikes-in-aigueestortes-i-estany-de-sant-maurici","https://www.spain.info/en/nature/aiguestortes-national-park/","https://www.baldhiker.com/walking-in-aiguestortes-i-estany-de-sant-maurici-national-park/","https://www.takeyourbackpack.com/backpacking-in-spain/visit-aiguestortes-i-estany-de-sant-maurici/","https://curiositysavestravel.com/national-park-catalonia-spain-aiguestortes-i-estany-de-sant-maurici/"],"method":"web"},"sources":["web"]},{"name":"Soak at the Caldes de Boi springs","type":"experience","detail":"A thermal house at about 1,500 m draws on dozens of separate springs, some near freezing and some close to 56 